+ # Delivery retries
+
+-Failed deliveries are retried every 5 minutes for one hour.
++Failed deliveries are retried with capped exponential backoff: 30s, 1m, 2m, 4m …
++capped at 1h per delay, 12 retries in total (about 9 hours).
+
+-There is no way to see or replay a delivery that ran out of retries.
++Deliveries that run out of retries show up under **Failed deliveries** in the
++dashboard, where an operator can replay them one by one.
+
+ ## Idempotency
+
