+      "md": "The scheduler is stateless. It computes the next delay from the attempt number carried in the message and publishes a **delayed copy** to the same queue. No polling loop, no extra table to scan, and a restart loses nothing because the delayed message lives in the broker.\n\n| attempt | delay (before jitter) |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | 30 s |\n| 2 | 1 m |\n| 4 | 4 m |\n| 8 | 1 h (cap) |\n| 12 | 1 h, then give up |",
